pyramids was actually really intentional.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.320
These were religious
and political structures.

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:06.282
They used it for ritual sacrifices,
for observing the stars,

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:09.118
