for life on the street.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:31.724
In city planning, we have density limits.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.562
The area of the site times
the allowable density for that zone.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:41.025
Basically, if the building's taller,
it needs to be slimmer.

00:06:41.442 --> 00:06:43.820
If it's fatter than needs to be shorter

00:06:44.028 --> 00:06:47.365
because the mass of the building,
it affects the daylight.

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:49.200
The wind, and it affects

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:53.079
in creating safe and pleasant spaces
for people on the street.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:57.750
So these massive structures,
they completely dominate the cityscape

00:06:58.042 --> 00:07:03.256
