00:13:50.579 --> 00:13:54.750
Not only does it
encourage overconsumption, not only does

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:58.003
it encourage onto spaces
that are supposed to be public spaces,

00:13:58.671 --> 00:14:41.046
commercializing building facades
lead to a loss of identity .

