Venice is one of those places

00:14:56.353 --> 00:14:59.857
where the city is
an integral part of the person's identity.

00:15:00.524 --> 00:15:04.028
So in Venice,
when buildings are being renovated,

00:15:04.236 --> 00:15:08.407
they cover it up with a tarp,
with an exact photo of the facade.

00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:11.827
Because to go months or years

00:15:11.827 --> 00:15:15.456
without that building,
it would be like losing a limb.

00:15:15.456 --> 00:15:19.418
Benjamin once said that to do
